# Test environment — points at the LOCAL Supabase stack only.
# Safe to commit: the Supabase keys below are the standard deterministic local-dev
# JWT tokens generated from the default JWT secret used by every supabase start.
# They are publicly documented and only work against 127.0.0.1:54421.
#
# The vitest setup fuse (src/tests/setup.ts) enforces that NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
# must start with http://127.0.0.1 or http://localhost — it aborts the run otherwise.

